# PAM stack for feh-display.service (weston as nick on tty9, for Waydroid/FEH display mode). systemd runs only the
# account + session phases for PAMName= services; the session stack registers a logind session on seat0 vt9, which
# is what gives weston DRM-master and input-device access. See feh-dumper RUNBOOK §5.
auth      substack  login
account   include   login
password  substack  login
session   include   login
